  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/f7qd/47",
  "contentHtml": "<p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>그동안 과학독서 동아리 시간에</p><p>3권의 책을 아이들과 함께 했었어요.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&lt;크로스 사이언스&gt;는 작년에도 읽었던 책인데, 아이들이 좋았다고 해서 다시 읽게 된 책입니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>책 속에 다른 책과 영화 소개들이 나오기 때문에</p><p>아이들에게 하이퍼링크 하고 싶은 다른 책이나 영화를 찾아보게 했어요.</p><p>그리고 책 속에서 인상깊었던 구절도 찾아보게 했고요.</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/afacb5efa623dc569cca72a3c4e1d02dfeb3e02a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/afacb5efa623dc569cca72a3c4e1d02dfeb3e02a\" data-orgin-width=\"455\" data-origin-height=\"960\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7cde75752cc507f0769aac642cc0f47ef9d8c6d5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7cde75752cc507f0769aac642cc0f47ef9d8c6d5\" data-orgin-width=\"455\" data-origin-height=\"960\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/77d614a4f14c64414cbf9285a6eea9c16e1b73f7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/77d614a4f14c64414cbf9285a6eea9c16e1b73f7\" data-orgin-width=\"481\" data-origin-height=\"960\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>두번째 책인 &lt;노벨상을 꿈꿔라5&gt;는</p><p>매년 나오는 책인데요...&#160;&#160;노벨상 수상자와 과학 관련 수상자들의 연구 결과를 아이들의 눈높이에 맞춰 설명해주는 책입니다. 그렇다해도 중3 정도의 과학 지식을 가지고 있어야 책 읽기가 어렵지 않기 때문에 중3 아이들과 읽을 만한 책이랍니다. 매년 이 책 사 모으는 재미도 좋아요..^^</p><p>&#160;</p><p>아이들과 이 책 함께&#160;읽으면서 실시간 퀴즈 대회 했어요.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/44e5a46d811caa6e2d351c08b2fe22581bf9fe47\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/44e5a46d811caa6e2d351c08b2fe22581bf9fe47\" data-orgin-width=\"455\" data-origin-height=\"960\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/672de82c1c0170d268a8b130fd4b5bb4b668fb16\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/672de82c1c0170d268a8b130fd4b5bb4b668fb16\" data-orgin-width=\"455\" data-origin-height=\"960\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b4a9b974b31f343a62b2a772a55bca942a95d68b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b4a9b974b31f343a62b2a772a55bca942a95d68b\" data-orgin-width=\"642\" data-origin-height=\"960\"><div class=\"figcaption\">&#160;</div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">퀴즈 열심히 참여하면서 답 달아주는 친구들은 </p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">생기부 동아리 활동란에 적극적으로 활동했다고 적어준다고 했어요...^^</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">책 읽고 난 뒤 느낌도 한 줄씩 써보라고 했습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/06f580f1031bd42554f7b9e196a860717f2f5320\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/06f580f1031bd42554f7b9e196a860717f2f5320\" data-orgin-width=\"455\" data-origin-height=\"960\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p>저번 주 동아리 시간에는 </p><p>제가 책을 골라주지 않고 각자 &quot;친구들에게 소개하고 싶은 과학 도서를 골라오도록&quot; 했어요.</p><p>하지만 무엇을 골라야할지 모르겠다면 &lt;야밤의 공대생 만화&gt;를 읽어보라고 추천해주었습니다.</p><p>이 책도 작년에 남학생들이 엄청 좋아했던 책이었거든요.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p>자신이 고른 책을 친구들에게 홍보하는 시간을 가졌는데...</p><p>직접 그리거나, 망고보드에서 만들어보도록 했습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a69c462b5e3f0580298f80d0a8b719c98dd529dc\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a69c462b5e3f0580298f80d0a8b719c98dd529dc\" data-orgin-width=\"720\" data-origin-height=\"960\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b7893602a53424aa86d91366573b41ed64947910\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b7893602a53424aa86d91366573b41ed64947910\" data-orgin-width=\"800\" data-origin-height=\"800\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f1e3d5d434a6af3f80f24d7020b3accd20fea7e7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f1e3d5d434a6af3f80f24d7020b3accd20fea7e7\" data-orgin-width=\"540\" data-origin-height=\"960\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4ab4b730b23206bec6d2b06a1a485834cc787995\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4ab4b730b23206bec6d2b06a1a485834cc787995\" data-orgin-width=\"679\" data-origin-height=\"960\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1e5776082d38372b0d76b183341c6c3ac2fc29b9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1e5776082d38372b0d76b183341c6c3ac2fc29b9\" data-orgin-width=\"678\" data-origin-height=\"960\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/07a98696c03bd8646eee2ef40d46b583847ffe3d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/07a98696c03bd8646eee2ef40d46b583847ffe3d\" data-orgin-width=\"540\" data-origin-height=\"960\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/84d7a7b62007bf88f34db2bf85d2e6eccb6c12a2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/84d7a7b62007bf88f34db2bf85d2e6eccb6c12a2\" data-orgin-width=\"960\" data-origin-height=\"310\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a4d48e900dc9ddd8c20dd9d7a3fca9b0e14f9043\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a4d48e900dc9ddd8c20dd9d7a3fca9b0e14f9043\" data-orgin-width=\"960\" data-origin-height=\"600\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
